Third-party material bundled in hed
===================================

data/en_freq.txt (embedded into the hed binary at build time)
  Source : https://github.com/wolfgarbe/SymSpell  (SymSpell/frequency_dictionary_en_82_765.txt)
  License: MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018 Wolf Garbe
  Note   : upstream describes this list as the intersection of SCOWL (Spell Checker
           Oriented Word Lists, permissive license) and word counts from the Google Books
           Ngram dataset (CC BY 3.0). It is distributed by the SymSpell project under MIT.

No other third-party code is included. Everything in src/ is original to hed (MIT).
The spelling algorithm (frequency-ranked Damerau-Levenshtein candidates) is a
well-known technique implemented from scratch; no SymSpell code is used.
